@model SoftCo.Models.SyncStatus

@* Whether a record has reached the accounting system.

   Read-only, and will say "Not synced" on everything until an integration exists - there is no Xero
   code in this system and none is planned in this work. It is here so that the day one is wired up,
   the state is already modelled, indexed and on screen rather than being retrofitted across four
   tables of live financial records.

   Deliberately rendered on detail screens only, never on every row of a list. A badge that says the
   same thing on all four hundred rows is not information, and people stop reading it long before it
   starts meaning anything. *@

<span class="sc-badge sc-sync sc-sync-@Model.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()">@Model.Label()</span>
